    LLM: 'Bid with trump length and 5s/Jacks; use the kitty to strengthen a hand when you win the auction.\n\nCoordinate with partner by leading from strength, protect key scoring cards, and avoid overbidding when your team is near game.\n\nTrack which high trumps (5, J, A♥) have been played, balance risk when bidding 30-for-60 or 60-for-120, and steer the play so that your partnership captures scoring tricks while forcing opponents to waste their trumps.',
    Player: 'Bid with trump length and 5s/Jacks; use the kitty to strengthen a hand when you win the auction.\n\nCoordinate with partner by leading from strength, protect key scoring cards, and avoid overbidding when your team is near game.\n\nTrack which high trumps (5, J, A♥) have been played, balance risk when bidding 30-for-60 or 60-for-120, and steer the play so that your partnership captures scoring tricks while forcing opponents to waste their trumps.',
